WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.156 --> 00:00:01.976
- Hello teachers, Sal here,

00:00:01.976 --> 00:00:04.166
from the not-for-profit Khan Academy,

00:00:04.166 --> 00:00:05.796
and I just wanted to thank you

00:00:05.796 --> 00:00:09.456
for all of your partnership
over the last 10 years.

00:00:09.456 --> 00:00:12.166
All of us here at Khan Academy,
it's much more than me now,

00:00:12.166 --> 00:00:14.796
we're over 200 folks,
including researchers,

00:00:14.796 --> 00:00:17.946
and teachers, and designers,
and we all recognize

00:00:17.946 --> 00:00:19.796
that the most important actor

00:00:19.796 --> 00:00:23.446
in a student's learning
experience is you the teacher.

00:00:23.446 --> 00:00:26.696
And that's why we've been so
excited to partner with you.

00:00:26.696 --> 00:00:31.036
Over 700,000 teachers have
registered for Khan Academy

00:00:31.036 --> 00:00:35.976
and helped us reach over
74 million students.

00:00:35.976 --> 00:00:38.576
There's over 1200 translators

00:00:38.576 --> 00:00:40.926
who have helped translate Khan Academy

00:00:40.926 --> 00:00:43.656
into over 40 languages that are being used

00:00:43.656 --> 00:00:46.786
pretty much around the
world in over 190 countries.

00:00:46.786 --> 00:00:49.356
And a lot of people think
of math when they think

00:00:49.356 --> 00:00:51.656
of Khan Academy, and we
do have a lot of math,

00:00:51.656 --> 00:00:54.176
but we've been able to
expand well beyond that

00:00:54.176 --> 00:00:58.546
into the sciences, the humanities,
computing, and the arts.

00:00:58.546 --> 00:00:59.936
So I really wanna thank you

00:00:59.936 --> 00:01:02.266
for going on this journey with us.

00:01:02.266 --> 00:01:05.616
I've often said if I had to
pick between an amazing teacher

00:01:05.616 --> 00:01:07.066
and an amazing technology,

00:01:07.066 --> 00:01:10.286
I would pick the amazing
teacher every time.

00:01:10.286 --> 00:01:13.266
But the good thing is we don't
have to make that trade off.

00:01:13.266 --> 00:01:16.416
Our goal is to try to
empower you, the teacher,

00:01:16.416 --> 00:01:19.756
with the tools you need to
best meet your students,

00:01:19.756 --> 00:01:23.116
to save you time, and improve outcomes

00:01:23.116 --> 00:01:24.576
so that your students learn more

00:01:24.576 --> 00:01:27.606
and become empowered
citizens for the world.

00:01:27.606 --> 00:01:30.186
So thank you for being
on this journey with us,

00:01:30.186 --> 00:01:32.206
and I really look forward
to seeing what we can do

00:01:32.206 --> 00:01:33.959
in the next decade together.

